====================================================================
5. WHY GPG KEY ?
====================================================================

Purpose

Verify package authenticity.

Ensures package is signed by Elastic.

Prevents tampered packages.

====================================================================
6. HOW APT KNOWS WHICH REPOSITORY TO USE ?
====================================================================

APT checks every repository present in

/etc/apt/sources.list

and

/etc/apt/sources.list.d/

Every repository contains package metadata.

When user installs package

Example

apt install elasticsearch

APT searches package name in all configured repositories.

If package exists only in Elastic repository,

APT downloads package from Elastic repository.

====================================================================
7. apt update vs apt upgrade
====================================================================

apt update

Downloads latest package metadata.

Does NOT install packages.

apt upgrade

Downloads and installs latest package versions.

