24. INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
====================================================================

Q. Difference between Elasticsearch and Kibana?

Elasticsearch stores and searches data.

Kibana visualizes Elasticsearch data.

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Difference between Filebeat and Logstash?

Filebeat

Collects Logs

Lightweight

Low Memory

Logstash

Processes Logs

Heavy

Filtering

Parsing

Transformation

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Difference between 9200 and 9300?

9200

REST API

Client Communication

9300

Node Communication

Cluster Internal Traffic

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Why JVM Heap?

To control Java memory usage.

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Why Grok?

Convert raw logs into structured fields.

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Why Mutate?

Modify parsed fields.

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Why Date Filter?

Convert timestamp into searchable date.

----------------------------------------------------

Q. Why GeoIP?

Generate Country, City and Coordinates from IP.

